#!/bin/zsh
# Double-click this file to open Chess Coach in your browser.
# It opens the published site, https://abustrup.github.io/Chess-Project/, which is the study version. During the
# study (until his 160th rated 10+0 game on Lichess) all training should happen there: a copy built from this folder
# could hold other or unfinished work, and it would keep a second, separate set of progress (and a second schedule
# for the Safety-check trainer). To work on the app itself, use `npm run dev` instead (see docs/HANDOFF.md).
open "https://abustrup.github.io/Chess-Project/"
